e him strength,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 or stood my ground before the triple shape\uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 of that Iberian herdsman Geryon,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 or faced you, Cerberus, and your three heads?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 Was it for this these hands of mine hauled down}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 the horns of that strong Cretan bull, and worked}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 at Elis, at the Stymphalian lake,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and in Parthenian woods? Thanks to their strength}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp41