 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and senses of wild beasts have understood\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 O Jupiter!\uc1 \u8212 ?the soul of Orpheus}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 slips away and vanishes in the winds. }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The grieving birds, the crowds of savage beasts, }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 the flinty rocks and woods, which so often}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 followed your songs, wept for you, Orpheus.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 Trees shed their leaves and, with their crowns now bare,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 grieved at your death, and rivers, too, men say,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 were swollen with their tears. Naiads and dryads,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 their hair unkempt, put on dark mourning clothes.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The poet\uc1 \u8217 ?s scattered limbs lay everywhere.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 You, Hebrus, received his head and lyre,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and (what is amazing!) as they floated}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 down the middle of the stream, the lyre}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 sounded some kind of doleful melody,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 the lifeless tongue intoned a sad lament,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and river banks echoed the plaintive song. }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 And then, carried down to the sea, they left}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 their native stream and were tossed up onshore}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 on Lesbos at Methymna. Here the head,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 as it lay on that foreign beach exposed,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 with its dishevelled hair still dripping wet,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 was assaulted by a ferocious snake.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 But as the beast was just about to bite,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 Phoebus finally appeared and stopped it.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 He froze the striking creature\uc1 \u8217 ?s open jaws}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and, in that posture, hardened it to stone.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \widctlpar \nooverflow \aspalpha \aspnum \faauto \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx426 \tql \tx1276 \tql \tx1843 \tql \tx6521 \tql \tx8505 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 The shade of Orpheus moved underground}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and recognized the places he had seen}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 on his earlier trip. He set out searching}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4