tlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 beat her chest, as she had done so frequently,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 and trailed her gray hair in congealing blood.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 She tore her breasts and cried out many things,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 including this:}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \par }\pard \plain \s41 \li0 \ri0 \widctlpar \nooverflow \aspalpha \aspnum \faauto \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \tql \tx426 \tql \tx1276 \tql \tx1843 \tql \tx6521 \tql \tx8505 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af0 \loch \af0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \par }\pard \plain \s47 \li426 \ri0 \widctlpar \nooverflow \aspalpha \aspnum \faauto \adjustright \lin426 \rin0 \tql \tx426 \tql \tx1276 \tql \tx1843 \tql \tx6521 \tql \tx8505 \itap0 \fs27 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af0 \loch \af0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160